  "contentHtml": "<p>재과만 톡톡에서 김정식 선생님께서 주신 아이디어로 손풍기 활용 빛 합성 실험이 간단하고 쉬워보여 만들어보고 있습니다.</p><p>마침 집에 자가발전 손풍기가 제격이라(앞에 가림망이 없어 더 편하네요) 가져와서 인터넷에서 색팽이 이미지를 다운받아 컬러 인쇄해서 작업했습니다. 양면테이프로 해보다가 뗐다 붙였다 하기에는 자석이 더 나을 것 같아 자석을 테이프로 붙여보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45d638e89cdf772feb512a3454f2a9eec07f0c82\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"220\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45d638e89cdf772feb512a3454f2a9eec07f0c82\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">손풍기 중앙에 얇고 둥근 자석 테잎으로 붙이기</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e35679da1ef5c4218697768be79ecd54ce9964f9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"186\" height=\"249\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e35679da1ef5c4218697768be79ecd54ce9964f9\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">색팽이 이미지를 인쇄하여 두꺼종이에 붙여 오린 후, 역시 자석 붙이기</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eeb88e5b9c1008c22eb7b9ca95210f5ee91c0441\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"206\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eeb88e5b9c1008c22eb7b9ca95210f5ee91c0441\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">색팽이 앞면(노랑+파랑)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6712915f079fe4f95270432b719225e015b2214b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"208\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6712915f079fe4f95270432b719225e015b2214b\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">색팽이 앞면(빨+파+초)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edd54e27237ea7896bfccba3aeb00dfe66a0885b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"212\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edd54e27237ea7896bfccba3aeb00dfe66a0885b\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"><div class=\"figcaption\">합체한 모습</div></div><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/IN2dxMeqB9c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/IN2dxMeqB9c</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"노랑+파랑\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"youtu.be\" data-og-source-url=\"https://youtu.be/IN2dxMeqB9c\" data-og-url=\"https://youtu.be/IN2dxMeqB9c\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b6c4tZ/hyLwisJPr3/oSnH2TUZYZUJy5eErUXZo1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/IN2dxMeqB9c\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://youtu.be/IN2dxMeqB9c\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b6c4tZ/hyLwisJPr3/oSnH2TUZYZUJy5eErUXZo1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">노랑+파랑</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">youtu.be</p></div></a></div><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/JiovYE5Vepk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/JiovYE5Vepk</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"빨강+파랑+초록\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"youtu.be\" data-og-source-url=\"https://youtu.be/JiovYE5Vepk\" data-og-url=\"https://youtu.be/JiovYE5Vepk\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/wV6vC/hyLuYilNjy/ZJKFle4Kojp7LvAy0zNOlk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/JiovYE5Vepk\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://youtu.be/JiovYE5Vepk\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/wV6vC/hyLuYilNjy/ZJKFle4Kojp7LvAy0zNOlk/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">빨강+파랑+초록</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">youtu.be</p></div></a></div><p>이론적으로는 노랑+파랑이나 빨강+파랑+초록은 같은 흰색이 나와야 하는데 노랑+파랑은 제법 흰색에 가까운데 3가지 색을 돌리면 회색 느낌이 납니다.&#160;</p><p>색상의 정확도 문제겠지요? 아님 노랑+파랑처럼 빨파초도 잘게 조각을 나누어 빨파초를 반복하게 하는게 좀 더 나을까요?</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
